{"title":"언노운 마더 구스","artist":"wowaka","sourceId":"reference:0MvCyF5Zwgf9FznBNHQE","sourceHash":"bb5a4384d1f6cda6b64534ab6e4c08e40b29ac88ee2697cc6aa1aeb0caefec97","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":25313179,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.3,"end":3.11,"text":"あたしが愛を語るのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.11,"end":4.95,"text":"その眼には如何、映像る？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":4.95,"end":7.39,"text":"詞は有り余るばかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":7.39,"end":9.35,"text":"無垢の音が流れてく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":9.35,"end":11.79,"text":"あなたが愛に塗れるまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":11.79,"end":13.63,"text":"その色は幻だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":13.63,"end":16.14,"text":"ひとりぼっち、音に呑まれれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":16.14,"end":18.38,"text":"全世界共通の快楽さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":35.23,"end":37.38,"text":"つまらない茫然に溺れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":37.38,"end":39.5,"text":"暮らし誰もが彼をなぞる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":39.5,"end":41.62,"text":"繰り返す使い回しの歌に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":41.62,"end":43.94,"text":"また耳を塞いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":43.94,"end":46.26,"text":"あなたが愛を語るのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":46.26,"end":48.22,"text":"それを答とするの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":48.22,"end":50.38,"text":"目をつぶったふりをしてるなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":50.38,"end":53.42,"text":"この曲で醒ましてくれ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":53.42,"end":57.25,"text":"誰も知らぬ物語　思うばかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":57.25,"end":61.77,"text":"壊れそうなくらいに　抱き締めて泣き踊った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":61.77,"end":63.92,"text":"見境無い感情論　許されるのならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":63.92,"end":66.05,"text":"泣き出すことすらできないまま　呑み込んでった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":66.05,"end":68.28999999999999,"text":"張り裂けてしまいそうな心があるってこと、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":68.28999999999999,"end":70.24,"text":"叫ばせて！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":70.24,"end":74.49,"text":"世界があたしを拒んでも今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":74.49,"end":78.89,"text":"愛の唄　歌わせてくれないかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":78.89,"end":83.17,"text":"もう一回　誰も知らないその想い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":83.17,"end":87.82,"text":"この声に預けてみてもいいかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":87.82,"end":89.93,"text":"あなたには僕が見えるか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":89.93,"end":92.1,"text":"あなたには僕が見えるか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":92.1,"end":96.38,"text":"ガラクタばかり　投げつけられてきたその背中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":96.38,"end":98.57,"text":"それでも好きと言えたなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":98.57,"end":100.7,"text":"それでも好きを願えたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":100.7,"end":104.74000000000001,"text":"ああ、あたしの全部に　その意味はあると――","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":130.78,"end":132.55,"text":"ねえ、愛を語るのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":132.55,"end":134.61,"text":"今その胸には誰がいる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":134.61,"end":136.82999999999998,"text":"こころのはこを抉じ開けて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":136.82999999999998,"end":139.02,"text":"さあ、生き写しのあなた見せて？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":139.02,"end":141.15,"text":"あたしが愛になれるのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":141.15,"end":143.3,"text":"今その色は何色だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":143.3,"end":145.55,"text":"孤独なんて記号では収まらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":145.55,"end":147.97,"text":"心臓を抱えて生きてきたんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":147.97,"end":149.1,"text":"ドッペルもどきが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":149.1,"end":150.23,"text":"其処いらに溢れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":150.23,"end":151.21,"text":"挙句の果ての今日","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":151.21,"end":152.46,"text":"ライラ　ライ　ライ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":152.46,"end":153.47,"text":"心失きそれを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":153.47,"end":154.55,"text":"生み出した奴等は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":154.55,"end":155.63,"text":"見切りをつけてもう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":155.63,"end":156.75,"text":"バイ　ババイ　バイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":156.75,"end":157.8,"text":"残されたあなたが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":157.8,"end":158.87,"text":"この場所で今でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":158.87,"end":159.94,"text":"涙を堪えてるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":159.94,"end":161.06,"text":"如何して、如何して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":161.06,"end":162.14,"text":"あたしは知ってるわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":162.14,"end":163.26,"text":"この場所はいつでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":163.26,"end":164.29,"text":"あなたに守られてき","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":164.29,"end":165.86,"text":"たってこと！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":165.86,"end":169.66,"text":"痛みなどあまりにも慣れてしまった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":169.66,"end":174.34,"text":"何千回と巡らせ続けた　喜怒と哀楽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":174.34,"end":176.31,"text":"失えない喜びが　この世界にあるならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":176.31,"end":178.66,"text":"手放すことすら出来ない哀しみさえ　あたしは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":178.66,"end":180.71,"text":"この心の中つまはじきにしてしまうのか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":180.71,"end":182.7,"text":"それは、いやだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":182.7,"end":186.94,"text":"どうやって　この世界を愛せるかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":186.94,"end":191.39,"text":"いつだって　転がり続けるんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":191.39,"end":195.63,"text":"ねえ、いっそ 誰も気附かないその想い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":195.63,"end":200.26,"text":"この唄で明かしてみようと思うんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":200.26,"end":202.38,"text":"あなたなら何を願うか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":202.38,"end":204.51,"text":"あなたなら何を望むか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":204.51,"end":208.91,"text":"軋んだ心が　誰より今を生きているの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":208.91,"end":211.06,"text":"あなたには僕が見えるか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":211.06,"end":213.14,"text":"あなたには僕が見えるか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":213.14,"end":217.31,"text":"それ、あたしの行く末を照らす灯なんだろう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":251.86,"end":254.07,"text":"ねえ、あいをさけぶのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":254.07,"end":255.83,"text":"あたしはここにいるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":255.83,"end":258.35,"text":"ことばがありあまれどなお、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":258.35,"end":260.1,"text":"このゆめはつづいてく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":260.1,"end":262.71,"text":"あたしがあいをかたるのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":262.71,"end":264.46,"text":"そのすべてはこのうただ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":264.46,"end":266.58,"text":"だれもしらないこのものがたり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":266.58,"end":269.22,"text":"またくちずさんでしまったみたいだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}